WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Isaac Sim kinematic concept. Primitive TPMS slot and tenon variants begin separated. The light-gray slot stays fixed.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:09.000
The darker tenon approaches its partner as the camera slowly changes angle. Original geometry is shown without cast shadows.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Both parts hold a nominal neighboring alignment. The physical insertion direction, fit, tolerance, and contact are not validated.
